Picto Third-Party Software Notices
==================================

Picto is licensed under the MIT License. See LICENSE.

This file identifies the programs that a Picto package holds beside the app, the prominent parts
that are compiled into the app, and the assets that it bundles. The app is built from the Rust
crates that `app/Cargo.lock` pins, and each of those crates declares its own license.

Every package holds this file, Picto's own license and the license texts named below, in a folder
`licenses` (`Contents/Resources/licenses` in the macOS app, `licenses` in the Windows installation
folder, `usr/share/licenses/picto` in the AppImage).

