------
Version: the revision of the Ruffle repository that `app/Cargo.toml` pins
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0
Source: https://github.com/ruffle-rs/ruffle

Ruffle's Rust crates are compiled into the app and play Flash files. The license texts that Ruffle
publishes are in `app/assets/LICENSE-Ruffle.md`.


GPUI
----
Version: 0.3.12 of the crates `gpui-pre`, with the changes that `app/vendor/README.md` lists
License: Apache-2.0
Source: https://github.com/zed-industries/zed

GPUI is the user interface framework that the app is written on. Six of its crates are in
